# tools/conformance/css_cssom_handports.py: the pages of the pinned web-platform-tests that touch the CSSOM and are ported by hand to a test program of tests/, because their script is not a straight line of recognized calls (an iframe, a promise, an observable array, a Markup document). Columns (tab separated): page, test program, number of its tests ported, the served sentence the page tests (its help link in the specification, and its title). The gate fails on a page that is not in the pin, a program that does not name it, a count below the floor, and a page of the list that is in the scored set.
